      "cooked": "<p>I am trying to understand the proper way to set up a bulk price for a specific customer group (Local Customers).<br>\nI want to be able to offer a reduced price on these customers buying 2 or 4 of the same product versus just one.</p>\n<p>An Example would be in Tires, the price would be<br>\n1 @ 119.99<br>\n2@ 229.99<br>\n4@ 449.99</p>\n<p>This type of discount I need a to apply across many items, but never with the same  price threshold (some discounts higher, some lower) so I would have to make each rule independently for the single product from what I can tell.</p>\n<p>Can anyone briefly advise me on this process, or if there is a better way to do this at the item level versus creating these rules?<br>\nThank you</p>",
